  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 minutes. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0703818d9f25cca80dc4/step-f38e7300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Crush the black peppercorns with a pestle and mortar or using a rolling pin.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0703818d9f25cca80dc4/step-48367110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0703818d9f25cca80dc4/step-8e782420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine carrot, mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of the vinegar and olive oil.\n• Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0703818d9f25cca80dc4/step-00719630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook corn, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Return rice to the saucepan and stir to combine. Remove from heat.\n• Stir in Japanese-style dressing. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0703818d9f25cca80dc4/step-96161140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide charred corn-brown rice and carrot salad between plates.\n• Top rice with peppercorn plant-based crumbed chicken to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b0703818d9f25cca80dc4/step-33d7aa50.jpg"
    }
  ]
